<title>INDIA: India's HDFC Bank lends 3-month money at 9.0 pct.</title>
<headline>India's HDFC Bank lends 3-month money at 9.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian private sector HDFC Bank said on Thursday it lent three-month term money at 9.0 percent per annum.</p>
<p>&quot;We have struck a deal to lend three-month money at 9.0 percent,&quot; a bank offciail said.</p>
<p>The official said the bank was quoting the following rates for term money:</p>
<p>Term		  Bid/Offer</p>
<p>			(per cent per annum)</p>
<p>-----------	 ---------------------</p>
<p>1 month		5.0/6.0</p>
<p>2 months	     7.0/8.0</p>
<p>3 months	     8.0/9.0</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
